# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile copies, and keep local build output and secrets out of it.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.vs
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
design
docs
tests
**/*.md
# ...except the texts the site reads at start (blog posts, About page, legal texts): without them the app stops at start.
!content/**/*.md
# Built by the "assets" stage; a local copy could be stale.
src/Peekbox.Web/wwwroot/js
